dstorm-microburst-appraisal/#breadcrumb"},{"@type":"Service","name":"Windstorm & Microburst Appraisal","serviceType":"Insurance appraisal","description":"Wind damage insurance claim in Maine underpaid? Appraisal for microburst, tornado and windstorm losses to roofs, siding, barns and outbuildings.","provider":{"@id":"https://maineinsuranceappraiser.com/#business"},"areaServed":{"@type":"State","name":"Maine"},"url":"https://maineinsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-work/windstorm-microburst-appraisal/","image":"https://maineinsuranceappraiser.com/assets/img/photos/storm-damage.webp","@id":"https://maineinsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-work/windstorm-microburst-appraisal/#service"},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Are tornadoes covered differently from other wind in Maine?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Usually not. Most homeowners policies treat tornado damage as windstorm damage. Read your policy, since some have special wind deductibles."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can a wind damage insurance claim in Maine include my barn?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Often yes, under other structures coverage, which usually has its own limit. Appraisal can set the amount of barn damage once coverage is accepted."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"The adjuster said my shingles only need a few repairs. What should I check?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ask whether anyone tested seal strips across the slope and whether replacement shingles match. Lifted shingles that resealed can still be damaged."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What if the storm was months ago?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Many policies require prompt notice and set a suit-limitation period. Check your policy and consult a Maine attorney about any deadline before relying on appraisal."}}],"@id":"https://maineinsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-work/windstorm-microburst-appraisal/#faq"}]}</script>
